            "sid": "ISA 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.47.1+ISA.47.2+ISA.47.3+ISA.47.4+ISA.47.5+ISA.47.6+ISA.47.7+ISA.47.8+ISA.47.9+ISA.47.10+ISA.47.11+ISA.47.12+ISA.47.13+ISA.47.14+ISA.47.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 47.1-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Yer 50.1–51.64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Olkilikuai oipirta Babilon apa otabolokoki Isaya olayioni le Amos. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nchumata e ndoinyo naisiaja tudumu olmonekie tabuaku nchiraki ninche; iyuku ninche te nkaina metijing'u nena shomito oo lkituaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aitanapa nanu makewan lelo gelunot laainei, aipotuo nanu lelo tung'ana laainei magil, pee eitalaku engoro ai, te lelo latagorokine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toning'o, embuakunoto too ldoinyo eba anaa eno lorora kitok! Toning'o, embuakunoto oo nkitoriat, e lelo oshon oosoto te nebo! Olaitoriani loo lororani oitobirita olarrabal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepuonu ninche eing'uaa enkop nalakua, eing'uaa enkiting'oto e keper, nelotu Olaitoriani eeta iruparen enyena pee eidaikie enkop pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoe 1.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Enteyietu enchira amu etataana enkolong o Laitoriani; pee elotu ina kidaata naing'uaa olmagilani! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina kelepori nkaik pooki, neiropijaa empijan e pooki tung'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa keiputukuny ninche. Nejing ninche emion naikununo anaa ene nkitok nasaisai. Neing'ura ninche maate to lkirutoto; neiput enkurruna nkomomi enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura, kelotu enkolong o Laitoriani, ina olong torrono engoro, o empijan e mpushuna, pee eitaa enkop olmuaate neidaikie lelo aing'okok lenyena aishie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.32.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 32.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 24.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.13.24+MRK.13.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 13.24-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.21.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 21.25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.12+REV.6.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 6.12-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amu ore ilakir le keper, nemeitoki aaishoru ewang'an enye; nemisimisu enkolong eilepu nemeitoki olapa aitawang'isho te wang'an enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaitame nanu enkop te nkaraki eng'oki enye, naitame lelo arruok te nkaraki enkarruoisho enye; kaiting'ie nanu ilo wuasa le lelo ooitokoos, naitadou nanu olwuasa le lelo ooing'ola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaitaa nanu iltung'ana iloodoorieki anaa sahabu nasila netiu iltung'ana anaa sahabu e Ofir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina kaikirikirie nanu keper, neigusugusieki enkop te ine wueji enye, te ina goro o Laitoriani loo lororani te ina olong e ngoro enye napi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore anaa entarakuet narreshitoi, aashu anaa nkerra nemeetae oltung'ani oiturrur, keibelekenyakino ake oltung'ani olorere lenye, neisik ake oltung'ani alo enkop enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore oloba anaa oloinepuni neari metua; ore oloba anaa oloibung'i nebatata to lalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nkera enye kutiti naa kedung'udung'i te dukuya nkonyek enye, keibung'i nkajijik enye, ore nkituaak enye neikonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura, kaputu nanu lelo le Amedi metarasaki ninche, lelo lemeshilaa enkosholai; nemeshipakino sahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkai enye naar ilbarnot metuata; nemeing'urrie ninche ina natii enkoshoke e ng'otonye; ore nkonyek enye nemeeta olng'ur too nkera kutiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 19.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore Babilon, ina kitoo oo nkitoriat, ina kishiaa nawuasare Ilkaldayo, nelo atiu anaa Sodom o Gomora ina kata te nenang'aa Enkai ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meigili ae kata aamany ninye aashu aatoni ti atua ninye too ishoritin pooki; meetae Olmarabui oigil aun olng'obor lenye te ine; nemeetae ilairritak loo ntare ooigil aairragie nkerrai enye te ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.34.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 34.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEP.2.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Sefa 2.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 18.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake ing'uesi e ntim naapuo aairrag te ine, ore inkajijik enye neiput nkeenta enkop; nemany isidan ine, neitigiran ntarakueti te ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nekueni ilng'ojiniaa too ltaleta lenyena,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
